    "zh": "该产品为塑料管材，主要材质为ABS，适用于玩具等应用场景，支持规格定制与批量供货。",
    "en": "This plastic tube is primarily made from ABS and is suitable for Toy applications. Custom dimensions and bulk supply are supported."
