      "包装与交付可按需求配置（如重量(g) 20），支持稳定供货与长期项目协同。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This plastic tube is designed for industrial and consumer assembly programs requiring protection, covering, guidance, and connection functions.",
      "The primary material is ABS, and dimensions such as outer diameter, wall thickness, length, and profile form can be aligned to project requirements.",
      "Packaging and delivery can be configured as needed (for example: Weight (g) 20), supporting stable supply and long-term project coordination."
    ]
